EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Whaat?!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Really?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Well, if you say so...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I'll just keep on riding this crazy
