TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Nee?!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Cidden mi?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Madem öyle diyorsun...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Bir süre daha şu çılgın
“{{TAG:0005:0007:}}” treninde yol almaya devam!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}You know,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I've been feeling a little
down lately.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Just not really myself,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
you know what I mean?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}But I think you just fixed me!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Sorry you had to see that wimpy
side of me,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Biliyor musun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} son zamanlarda biraz
moralim bozuktu.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Pek kendim gibi değildim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ne demek istediğimi anladın mı?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ama galiba beni düzelttin!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Şu pısırık hâlimi gördüğün için kusura
bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ça m'apprendra à écouter l'avis des
autres.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Il faut en tenir compte, oui...{{TAG:0007:0001:}} mais
seulement quand on est d'accord !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}È vero, non dovrei perdermi in un
