Aaaah!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ora mi sento meglio!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}} AHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}My style's so tasty now, I wouldn't
be surprised if someone tried to
take a bite outta me! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Con esta de haber cambiado
